  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Removing barriers, improving access to SRHR - Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program is implemented by three partner organizations; Fundac&#xed;on Ori&#xe9;ntame, La Mesa por la Vida y la Salud de las Mujeres and Fondo Lunaria Mujer, that together address sexual and reproductive health and rights in Colombia. The programme focuses on access to safe and legal abortion, comprehensive sexuality education, and family planning.</narrative>
  </description>
